</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Sandy, I am sorry that your machine does not work and I know you feel persecuted by thirty years of disregard and disbelief. If I have learned your personality correctly over the years, my sympathy is tasteful to you. How does one apologize for that, for another man's distaste? Anyhow, I am sorry about your machine.<br>
